<title>SWEDEN: OM says in talks with Stockholm bourse.</title>
<headline>OM says in talks with Stockholm bourse.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish electronic trading systems group OM said on Friday it had entered into discussions with the Stockholm Stock Exchange regarding possible cooperation in technology and market issues.</p>
<p>OM said in a statement its aim was to strengthen the position of the Stockholm bourse amidst intensifying European competition.</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom, +46-8-700 1006</p>
</text>
